# Conformance probe pack for a field that covers its own gate (spec 0.17,
# rulings 3 and 7). Fixed `bits` layout, least significant bit first. Public.
# No kinds. One byte per word. Exercises: a present field wins over the gate
# value on the bits they share, so the output holds the block only when the
# field's own low bits equal the gate value (step 6).
#
#   byte 0       x, when its low two bits are 1
#   byte 1       y, outside any block
format     conformance-gates-overlap
version    0.17.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
if      0:0:2  1
  field probe.x  0:0:8   uint
end
field   probe.y  0:8:8   uint
